Disposition
- The corrected exact-ID regression failed on real output loss. No zero-drop or regression-free result is claimed.
- No runtime fix or efficiency benchmark was performed. Commander owns the revised production design scope; details from source review are in `../reports/report_rotation-gap.md`.
